**Convention 9.3 (other supplied interfaces).** The public
[finite-reader synthesis volume][FCS], especially Theorem 6.1 and
Theorem 10.2, distinguishes choosing some lawful acquired-term code for
a fixed finite reader from verifying a prescribed program. It assumes
acquired whole terms on a repeated-partner inverse fiber and gives no
bounded preparer for the original all-depth task. This volume uses no
transfer of that result; Theorem 7.1 supplies its own actual paid scan.

The source declaration `FiniteNaturalJoin.join_covers` requires two
`Covers` premises on the same full assignment. It does not supply a
global law or its mass. `NativeDepthPatterns.original_present_transport`
requires an actual present occurrence, used precisely in (OCC.27).
The finite-root minimax and effective-root-criterion declarations concern
complete predecessor-row recovery after a certified actual substitution,
with a prefix-free cut, nonempty origin fiber and compatible acquired
image values in the latter criterion. No all-length stationary-source
cap follows from them, and no compilation is asserted here.

[RCE][RCE]'s range extension, [JPL][JPL]'s specified joint-potential
boundaries and the existing joint/scaffold/stability rules remain within
their own grammars. The present result adds no rule to those grammars,
removes none, and supplies no counterexample to their unrestricted
optimizer-cofinality. A generic local uniqueness failure would not
justify such a conclusion.

**Open problem 9.4 (the weighted global completion still required).**
In a conditional-integration route, the additional joint relation is the
original component law

$$
\pi_C=\frac{Z_C}{\sum_{C'}Z_{C'}},\qquad
Z_C=\sum_{s\in C}\prod_i\Phi_i(s),
\tag{OCC.29}
$$

with each original whole-block weight once and all actual guards,
compatibility zeros and shared incidences retained. This law must be
derived from the unchanged actual fiber, or its contribution bounded
uniformly across all original templates. Compatible bounded-owner
conditionals, even together with the globally realizable local COK laws,
do not by themselves provide that missing relation. Complete component
enumeration handles each finite instance and this explicit family, but
does not bound the all-size extremum.

The original obligation remains a total computable sound cap verifier
whose accepted rational labels are optimizer-cofinal for every original
$\sigma_d$, or a uniform effective original length-error bound yielding
two-sided approximation of the same $\lambda$. General exact $M_1(D)$,
sharp $\lambda$, that effective bridge, and the broader mutual-recovery
programme remain open. No current numerical rate endpoint is asserted
by this volume. The operational relation proved here recovers a requested
full temporal trajectory after one paid native reply; it does not
recover arbitrary physical space and time, an unseen history or unknown
age, or the declared authentication and access services.

